# Compiled single-file executables from `bun run build:binaries`.
# These are RELEASE ASSETS (attached to the GitHub Release by
# `release-mcp-binaries` in .github/workflows/release.yml), never commits —
# each one is ~60–80 MB of embedded Bun runtime.
release/

# `bun build --compile` scratch files, left behind if a compile is interrupted.
*.bun-build
